An orcish guard patrols here.~
{010}He is a brutish looking orc.  His skin is grey-green in color and covered with
coarse hair.  His forehead juts out and his nose is snoutlike.  His ears are
short and pointed and resemble those of a wolf and he has sharp canine teeth.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
-200 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_CLAW 1d1+10000 1d1+100
10000 RACE_ORC
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 6
  if class($n) == 5
    if quest(0, 2, $n) == 1
      say A greeting to you, Shaman $n.
    endif
  else
    if quest(0, 2, $n) == 1
      if class($n) == 2
        if level($n) > 89
          bow $n
          say Welcome Chief $n.
        else
          if level($n) > 70
            say Welcome Subchief $n.
          else
            if level($n) > 50
              say What do you want, $n?
            else
              say Get out of my face, Dung Breath.
            endif
          endif
        endif
      else
        if class($n) == 3
          if level($n) > 89
            bow $n
            say Welcome Chief $n.
          else
            if level($n) > 70
              say Welcome Subchief $n.
            else
              if level($n) > 50
                say What do you want, $n?
              else
                say Get out of my face, Dung Breath.
              endif
            endif
          endif
        else
          if class($n) == 6
            if level($n) > 89
              bow $n
              say Welcome Chief $n.
            else
              if level($n) > 70
                say Welcome Subchief $n.
              else
                if level($n) > 50
                  say What do you want, $n?
                else
                  say Get out of my face, Dung Breath.
                endif
              endif
            endif
          else
            mpecho The orc is afraid to meet your gaze.
            say Greetings to you, Witch Doctor $n.
          endif
        endif
      endif
    else
      say Talk to chief Big Nose if you are new here.
    endif
  endif
else
  if race($n) == 2
    shout Elven scum has entered the village!
    say Your ears are mine, scum!
    rescale 2815 $n 130
    mpkill $n
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
    break
  endif
  if quest(0, 2, $n) == 2
    shout An enemy of the camp is here!
    rescale 2815 $n 110
    mpkill $n
  endif
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 0~
if class($n) == 6
  if quest(30, 1, $n) == 0
    shout I have banished a filthy assassin!
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
  else
    mptransfer $n 2899
    mpat $n mpforce $n say I am a loser!
    shout I have sent a backstabbing assassin to hell!
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if race($n) == 6
  mpecho The orc gives a curse and a grunt of admiration as it dies.
else
  if race($n) == 2
    say No, I can not lose to a pointy eared freak!
  else
    shout $n has betrayed the orcs!
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
  endif
endif
~
|
