#2822
elven spy~
an elven spy~
An elven spy hides here in the shadows.~
He is dressed in drab colors so that he may better hide among the orcish
swine.~
ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_HIDE|AFF_STEALTH|AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_TONGUES 0 S
40 0 0 1D1+631 1D1+26
1000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 2
  if actorhasobjnum(12143)
    if quest(5, 3, $n) == 0
      say Pssst.  Over here.
      say You must be the one sent by the elven council.
      say Your orders are to kill the chief but don't get caught.
      say Return to me when you are done.
      mpmset $n quest 5 3 1
    else
      if quest(0, 2, $n) == 2
        say You were caught in your attempt on the chief's life.
        say I am afraid that will not do.
      else
        if quest(5, 3, $n) == 2
          if sex($n) == 1
            say Good Work Brother.
          else
            say Good Work Sister.
          endif
          say Give this to the council as proof that you have completed
          say your mission.
          mpoload 2813
          give i2813 $n
          mpmset $n quest 5 3 3
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
#2823
timeethereal~
timeethereal~
~
resets questbits at midnight~
ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_ETHEREAL 0 S
1 0 0 1D1+10000 1D1+100
0 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if time() == 0
  if quest(0, 2, $n) == 2
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 0
    mpecho The camp seems to have quieted down a bit.
  endif
endif
~
|
